; LowRider V4 - quarter-inch full-bed square-loop facing
; Conventional milling, outside to center, clockwise rectangular loops
; Tool: 6.35 mm (1/4 inch)
; Stepover: 4.7625 mm (75% tool width)
; Final facing plane: Z-0.10 mm from operator-established Z0
; Cutting feed: 5400 mm/min; plunge: 250 mm/min; travel: 11700 mm/min
; Use Mainsail speed factor to throttle the 5400 mm/min programmed feed.
; Router control is manual. Home XYZ and set Z0 before starting.
; Full pass begins on the exact X0..1020 and Y0..620 soft-limit perimeter.
; Square corners are retained on every inset to prevent uncut corner crescents.

